  <!-- Tutorial -->
  <string name="tutorial_title_1">welcome to polar.</string>
  <string name="tutorial_desc_1">the minimalist application meticulously designed to organize your tasks and reminders as elegantly as possible.\n\ndiscover how to boost your daily productivity while always staying in control, distraction-free, and with exceptional performance.</string>
  <string name="tutorial_title_2">task management</string>
  <string name="tutorial_desc_2">group your responsibilities by creating dedicated lists for work, home, or special projects, and organize everything with custom tags.\n\nbreak down large goals by adding unlimited subtasks, and track your progress in a visually rewarding way.</string>
  <string name="tutorial_title_3">smart creation</string>
  <string name="tutorial_desc_3">type completely naturally: "buy bread at 5pm on tuesday" or "meeting tomorrow morning".\n\nour powerful smart engine will automatically detect and extract the date and time, scheduling the task for you.</string>
  <string name="tutorial_title_4">quick actions</string>
  <string name="tutorial_desc_4">gently swipe a task to the right on a list to instantly mark it as completed.\n\nmade a mistake or no longer need to do something? swipe left and delete it without opening any menus.</string>
  <string name="tutorial_title_5">calendar and alerts</string>
  <string name="tutorial_desc_5">view all your routines grouped month by month or week by week in our premium design calendar.\n\nreceive precise notifications just in time so you never miss a meeting, deadline, or important detail again.</string>
  <string name="tutorial_title_6">total customization</string>
  <string name="tutorial_desc_6">adapt the application to your own style with our 4 display modes: dark, light, multicolor dark, and multicolor light.\n\nplus, choose the typography that best suits you from a carefully curated selection of professional fonts.</string>
  <string name="tutorial_title_7">statistics and progress</string>
  <string name="tutorial_desc_7">keep a comprehensive record of your daily life, visualizing completed tasks, overdue items, and your most productive day.\n\nmaintain long completion streaks to outdo yourself and achieve everything you set out to do with polar\'s data.</string>
  
